<p>You have lived through many battles, and your experience makes you a gritty veteran.</p><p>Saw Wheels end of effect attack increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30%.</acronym></p><p>Grinding Shield lets you live below your normal limits, up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-60, -123, -172, -213, -250</acronym> life.</p><p>Punishment has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">30%, 48%, 62%, 74%, 85%</acronym> chance to have its cooldown reduced by 1 for each effect.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Domination for all!</span></span></p>